# Storybook-first UI

When changing UI, look up the component in Storybook first (`packages/storybook/src/`, including `tahti-web/`) and use it.

- Do not hand-roll a second badge, tab strip, dialog, empty state, loader, or image treatment if Storybook already has one.
- Keep the screen's existing data and features. Adapt the Storybook primitive to that data; do not overwrite behavior to match a simpler demo.
- If nothing in Storybook matches, add the component there with the states that exist today, and flag missing states on the story.
- If a Storybook story is unused in the player and tahti-web, flag it as an orphan on that story.

Full text: root `AGENTS.md` → Storybook-first UI; `packages/tahti-web/AGENTS.md` Design system compliance.
